{"id":"dbd0dbd400225ff2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-fine-filter.md","title":"ZFC Fine Filter","display":"df-zfc-fine-filter — ZFC Fine Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fine-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fine-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-fine-filter — ZFC Fine Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fine-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fine-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fine-filter — ZFC Fine Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,X,Y\\in V\">\\(F,X,Y\\in V\\)</span> (filter, index carrier, and underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fine\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S(F,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X,\\subseteq)\\land\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in X\\mid y\\in a\\}\\in F\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fine\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S(F,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X,\\subseteq)\\land\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in X\\mid y\\in a\\}\\in F\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S$ (filter predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fine\\text{-}filter} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{FineFilter}_S(F,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nX\\subseteq\\mathcal P(Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X,\\subseteq)\\land\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in X\\mid y\\in a\\}\\in F\\bigr)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":790,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad